WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:02,910
Look, how do you collect these clothes?

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:04,910
Look, how much does it cost per pound?

3
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,910
Forget it, just think of it as helping me dispose of the garbage.

4
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:08,910
I'm too lazy to take it over there, so I'll just give it to you.

5
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:10,910
Then let me help you take out the garbage.

6
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,910
What do you need me to do

7
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,910
Well, the light bulb in my house happened to be broken.

8
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:17,910
I don’t have a ladder either. You are so tall, can you help me unscrew it?

9
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:20,910
It's right here. It's very simple. Just screw it back a little.

10
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:22,980
OK, I'll try

11
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:25,980
Oops, thank you. My husband has always said that he wants to change it.

12
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,980
But he was too busy at work. When he came back, he was tired and had no time to take care of him.

13
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,980
You are still awesome, thank you

14
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,980
You're welcome, can I go then?

15
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:33,980
Yes, of course

16
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:36,980
Well, I will still have used clothes in the future, or my family will need to move.

17
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,980
If you need anything else, you can call me. This is my phone number.

18
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,620
Good

19
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:48,820
Is this right?

20
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,950
How do you calculate money?

21
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:52,020
What do you want to lift?

22
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:54,020
A washing machine at my house is broken and I need to take it to be repaired.

23
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:57,020
But they said they wouldn't help lift it, and if they did, they would have to pay extra.

24
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:00,020
Can you help me lift it? If so, how much will it cost?

25
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,020
Do you have any old clothes?
